07-the-world-food-day/audio/p10-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"After","charStart":0,"charEnd":5,"startMs":0,"endMs":380},{"word":"tasting","charStart":6,"charEnd":13,"startMs":380,"endMs":940},{"word":"the","charStart":14,"charEnd":17,"startMs":940,"endMs":1180},{"word":"food","charStart":18,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1180,"endMs":1540},{"word":"Ms","charStart":24,"charEnd":26,"startMs":2040,"endMs":2220},{"word":"Park","charStart":28,"charEnd":32,"startMs":2400,"endMs":2460},{"word":"asked","charStart":33,"charEnd":38,"startMs":2460,"endMs":2940},{"word":"What","charStart":41,"charEnd":45,"startMs":3480,"endMs":3600},{"word":"did","charStart":46,"charEnd":49,"startMs":3600,"endMs":3760},{"word":"you","charStart":50,"charEnd":53,"startMs":3760,"endMs":3920},{"word":"learn","charStart":54,"charEnd":59,"startMs":3920,"endMs":4120},{"word":"today","charStart":60,"charEnd":65,"startMs":4120,"endMs":4440}]},{"id":"daily-207-the-world-food-day-p10-s2","ord":1,"text":"Mina raised her hand. \"Food shows us who people are and where they come from.\"","translation_ko":"미나가 손을 들었어요. \"음식은 사람들이 어디서 왔는지 보여줘요.\"","audioUrl":"/seed/daily-207-the-world-food-day/audio/p10-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Mina","charStart":0,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":440},{"word":"raised","charStart":5,"charEnd":11,"startMs":440,"endMs":880},{"word":"her","charStart":12,"charEnd":15,"startMs":880,"endMs":1060},{"word":"hand","charStart":16,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1060,"endMs":1420},{"word":"Food","charStart":23,"charEnd":27,"startMs":2280,"endMs":2320},{"word":"shows","charStart":28,"charEnd":33,"startMs":2320,"endMs":2600},{"word":"us","charStart":34,"charEnd":36,"startMs":2600,"endMs":2840},{"word":"who","charStart":37,"charEnd":40,"startMs":2840,"endMs":3000},{"word":"people","charStart":41,"charEnd":47,"startMs":3000,"endMs":3260},{"word":"are","charStart":48,"charEnd":51,"startMs":3260,"endMs":3560},{"word":"and","charStart":52,"charEnd":55,"startMs":3560,"endMs":4300},{"word":"where","charStar